            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3 d-flex align-items-center">
                <span class="p-2 bg-primary-subtle text-primary rounded-circle me-2"><i class="bi bi-ticket-perforated-fill"></i></span>
                วิธีแลกส่วนลดด้วยคะแนน (Redeem Points)
            </h6>
